        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/mod#PSI-MOD-slim"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Some sources compute the difference formula for charged, quatenary modified lysine based on protonated lysine rather than neutral lysine residue. In such cases, a comparable difference formula can be calculated based on this derivative.</rdfs:comment>
