        <rdfs:comment>CAUTION - observations of this modifation are attributable to artifacts produced in preparation. It is extremely unlikely that eukaryotes produce this modification, because an enzyme acting to form the methyl ester of L-aspartyl peptides would interfere with the D-aspartyl peptide repair mechanism [JSG].</rdfs:comment>
